WEBVTT

00:13:44.794 --> 00:13:47.597
(Video) Peter Parker: ♪
Standing on the precipice,

00:13:47.621 --> 00:13:52.076
I can soar away from this. ♪

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:54.434
JT: We're trying to do
everything in live theater

00:13:54.458 --> 00:13:56.353
that you can't do in two dimensions

00:13:56.377 --> 00:13:58.879
in film and television.

00:13:58.903 --> 00:14:02.809
PP: ♪ Rise above yourself
and take control. ♪